When 4 or more of the {{term:domain-card|domain cards}} in your {{term:loadout|loadout}} are from the Arcana domain, gain the following benefits:

- +1 bonus to your {{term:spellcast-roll|Spellcast Rolls}}
- Once per rest, you can switch the results of your {{term:hope|Hope}} and {{term:fear|Fear}} Dice.

When 4 or more of the {{term:domain-card|domain cards}} in your {{term:loadout|loadout}} are from the Bone domain, gain the following benefits:

- +1 bonus to {{term:agility|Agility}}
- Once per rest, you can **spend 3 {{term:hope|Hope}}** to cause an attack that succeeded against you to fail instead.

When 4 or more of the {{term:domain-card|domain cards}} in your {{term:loadout|loadout}} are from the Valor domain, gain the following benefits:

- +1 bonus to your {{term:armor-score|Armor Score}}
- When you mark 1 or more {{term:hit-points|Hit Points}} without marking an {{term:armor-slot|Armor Slot}}, clear an {{term:armor-slot|Armor Slot}}.
